  "html": "<html lang="en"><body><p>The 5th Medical Students Research Conference</p><p>Conference dates: 27–28 January 2027.</p><p>You have a seat at the conference.</p><p>Sign in to view your ticket: <a href="https://www.msrc2027.com/en/registration/ticket">https://www.msrc2027.com/en/registration/ticket</a></p><p>Support: contact@msrc2027.com</p></body></html>",
